  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c0cbb63e218a4414a796a60ffe37dd3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  info: "In this example, clicks on UI elements (the buttons) do not pass through
    to the clickable and draggable objects in the background.\n\nHow it works:\n\nThe
    Use Event System property is enabled on the clickable and draggable objects.
    The camera also has a Physics2DRaycaster component attached. \n\nIf you are using
    3D colliders on the clickable / draggable objects you should use the PhysicsRaycaster
    component instead."
